note contract 5 layout line 159 with OMEGESE 9.4: a constant field index outside COUNT is error 21,
note as for an array (confirmed by erratum E8).
om2
layout shactx 104
field state uint 8 at 0 little
field count ulong at 32 little
field buf uchar 64 at 40 little
end
fn poke c edit shactx to void
put c buf 64 1
end
fn main to int
c = new uchar 104 0
poke c
ret 0
end
